OL,3,AFifteen taken to hospital after
OL,4,Adeliberate fire at Glasgow flats
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice are treating a fire at a block
OL,7,Fof flats in Glasgow as deliberate.
OL,9,FFour fire engines were sent to the
OL,10,Ffour-storey building on Copland Road,
OL,11,Fin the Ibrox area, just after 17:00 on
OL,12,FFriday after reports of a fire on the
OL,13,Fground floor.
OL,15,FFirefighters and paramedics initially
OL,16,Fsaid they were dealing with "multiple
OL,17,Fcasualties" and police have now
OL,18,Fconfirmed 15 people were taken to
OL,19,Fhospital as a precaution.
OL,21,FThe fire was extinguished and crews
OL,22,Fleft the scene by 22:00.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
